    "diagnosis": "Mucinous carcinoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Pure&nbsp;mucinous carcinoma&nbsp;with nests of tumour cells within mucin pools. Mucinous carcinomas&nbsp;commonly have an inverted micropapillary-like&nbsp;appearance. An adjacent mucocele-like lesion with low nuclear grade DCIS is seen.",
